   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 294.64435,
   "end": 298.881917,
   "transcript": "emails Hauser a list of every change they'd need to make to stay inside it."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 300.183217,
   "end": 303.319683,
   "transcript": "But it's already August. The game ships in October."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 307.307,
   "end": 308.624983,
   "transcript": "And this is the decision,"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 308.95865,
   "end": 314.16385,
   "transcript": "the single decision that everything else in this story grows out of."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 328.328,
   "end": 331.364367,
   "transcript": "There wasn't time to pull the content out of the code"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 332.08175,
   "end": 333.6333,
   "transcript": "without breaking the game."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 335.868867,
   "end": 337.4371,
   "transcript": "So Rockstar didn't remove it."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 338.8385,
   "end": 339.7394,
   "transcript": "They locked it."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 342.99265,
   "end": 344.377367,
   "transcript": "The animations stayed."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 346.4461,
   "end": 347.880867,
   "transcript": "lines stayed."
