   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 570.436533,
   "end": 574.807567,
   "transcript": "pulls the animations up against character models to see what they actually are."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 578.010767,
   "end": 580.32975,
   "transcript": "They're exactly what the names"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 590.573317,
   "end": 597.880617,
   "transcript": "So by Christmas 2004, a handful of people on the internet know that Rockstar shipped something it has never mentioned."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 598.598,
   "end": 599.9994,
   "transcript": "They just can't reach it."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 601.467533,
   "end": 603.819883,
   "transcript": "To reach it, they need the PC version."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 606.85625,
   "end": 608.674733,
   "transcript": "And Wildenborg has a problem."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 613.8132,
   "end": 615.36475,
   "transcript": "He lives in the wrong country."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 627.043083,
   "end": 631.297333,
   "transcript": "Andreas on PC three days after North America."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 632.014717,
   "end": 634.650683,
   "transcript": "Wildenburg doesn't want to wait three days."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 637.08645,
   "end": 638.638,
   "transcript": "So he finds a motor"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 641.624317,
   "end": 643.99335,
   "transcript": "in the United States who already has it."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 652.635317,
   "end": 654.40375,
   "transcript": "The American sends him the"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 656.839517,
   "end": 660.376383,
   "transcript": "script file. Wildenborg opens it in a hex editor."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 661.594267,
   "end": 664.347017,
   "transcript": "A tool that lets you edit raw code directly."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 667.81715,
   "end": 670.41975,
   "transcript": "Rewrites the section that keeps the content locked."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 672.688683,
   "end": 673.739733,
   "transcript": "And sends it back."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 679.5789,
   "end": 682.715367,
   "transcript": "Which brings us back to 11.37 that night."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 685.5849,
   "end": 687.970617,
   "transcript": "And the video landing in his inbox."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 689.572217,
   "end": 693.5929,
   "transcript": "The next day he uploads the patch to a modding site called GTA Garage."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 696.128767,
   "end": 701.05035,
   "transcript": "the game itself uses. He calls it Hot Coffee."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 705.087717,
   "end": 709.8091,
   "transcript": "Four weeks later, it's been downloaded more than a million"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 712.178133,
   "end": 719.702317,
   "transcript": "And on the day it goes up, Sam Houser finds out the way anyone else would have, by reading a Grand Theft Auto message board."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
