   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1660.241917,
   "end": 1662.427433,
   "transcript": "Same principle, different studio paying for it."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1666.731733,
   "end": 1671.8702,
   "transcript": "Take-Two quietly cancelled a game called Snow about the drug trade and gave no reason,"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1672.337333,
   "end": 1676.441433,
   "transcript": "while Lead Red as a company deciding it couldn't survive any more political attention."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1680.8792,
   "end": 1682.714367,
   "transcript": "And the modders who found the thing"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1684.716367,
   "end": 1685.7841,
   "transcript": "in the first place"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1690.422067,
   "end": 1692.157133,
   "transcript": "were treated as the cause of it."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1701.633267,
   "end": 1704.386017,
   "transcript": "gta garage took hot coffee down voluntarily"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1715.647267,
   "end": 1718.900517,
   "transcript": "modders were told future rockstar games would be far harder to alter"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1724.57285,
   "end": 1725.957567,
   "transcript": "some of them started worrying"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1728.8271,
   "end": 1730.195133,
   "transcript": "anything they ever unlocked"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1738.603533,
   "end": 1740.78905,
   "transcript": "would be assumed to have been hidden on purpose."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1742.323917,
   "end": 1743.508433,
   "transcript": "Doug Loewenstein"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1744.876467,
   "end": 1748.663583,
   "transcript": "ran the industry's own trade body was blunt about Rockstar going silent."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1752.267183,
   "end": 1755.987567,
   "transcript": "His point was that if you want to make provocative work, fine."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1756.387967,
   "end": 1760.475383,
   "transcript": "But then you stand up and defend it rather than hiding behind a statement about hackers."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1761.76,
   "end": 1764.81305,
   "transcript": "Dan Houser answered seven years later, sort"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1769.651217,
   "end": 1774.62285,
   "transcript": "His argument was that they were never really attacked for the content. They were attacked for the medium."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1775.006567,
   "end": 1779.160717,
   "transcript": "Put the same material in a novel or a film, he said, and nobody would have blinked."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1781.996883,
   "end": 1783.114667,
   "transcript": "He may well be right."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1786.618167,
   "end": 1788.4867,
   "transcript": "It changed nothing. The rules stayed."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1794.509383,
   "end": 1797.14535,
   "transcript": "Theft Auto 6 is the way it is."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1797.412283,
   "end": 1799.681217,
   "transcript": "Every acid Rockstar cuts from GTA 6"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1799.8981,
   "end": 1802.5007,
   "transcript": "now has to be actually deleted, not switched off."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1802.9011,
   "end": 1806.571433,
   "transcript": "Every locked texture, every unused animation, every abandoned mechanic"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1807.0052,
   "end": 1808.15635,
   "transcript": "still sitting in the files"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1808.389917,
   "end": 1816.648167,
   "transcript": "is something the ESRB has to be told about. Because since 2006, in the eyes of American regulators, if it's on the disc, you shipped it."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1821.486333,
   "end": 1823.705217,
   "transcript": "It's the reason Rockstar's new games"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1823.955467,
   "end": 1825.57375,
   "transcript": "are built to resist modding."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1828.409917,
   "end": 1830.829,
   "transcript": "the reason the disclosure paperwork"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1836.1343,
   "end": 1838.703533,
   "transcript": "It's the reason a studio spent 20 years"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1854.886367,
   "end": 1857.672483,
   "transcript": "of not caring about what anyone thought"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1865.380183,
   "end": 1867.131933,
   "transcript": "now has an entire process"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1872.554017,
   "end": 1874.305767,
   "transcript": "the box."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1888.03615,
   "end": 1889.621067,
   "transcript": "in the Netherlands."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1890.421867,
   "end": 1892.724167,
   "transcript": "One hex editor. One night in June."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1894.275717,
   "end": 1897.011783,
   "transcript": "He didn't break into anything. He didn't steal anything."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1898.112883,
   "end": 1899.380817,
   "transcript": "He didn't make anything."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1904.1022,
   "end": 1905.720483,
   "transcript": "just turned off a lock"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1907.15525,
   "end": 1909.05715,
   "transcript": "Rockstar had chosen not to delete."
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1912.46055,
   "end": 1913.978733,
   "transcript": "And 21 years later,"
  },
  {
   "clip": "hot-coffee-synced.mp4",
   "start": 1917.248667,
   "end": 1920.735483,
   "transcript": "The whole industry is still building around the hole he found."
